# Obrium

Before any task work, read and follow [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md).

Start each new task in a **new chat** with: `Read AGENTS.md and the task file`.
Do not continue a finished task’s thread.

Serve/tests: `npm run serve` (port 5501), `npm run test:quick` after edits, `npm run test:all` once before push.
